    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to Trishu-Drift</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The better you drift, the faster you go!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in the art of drifting with <strong>Trishu-Drift</strong>, where precision and style lead to speed and victory.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Drifting made unique:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enhance your driving strategy with unique mechanics:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nitrous:</strong> Earn nitrous by executing perfect drifts, passing your opponents and winning the race</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the balance between drifting and speed to dominate the competition.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Touge Challenges</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your skills on challenging mountain passes inspired by iconic Japanese touge:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intense Downhill Races:</strong> Navigate tight corners and steep descents that demand precision and control. Drive faster than the other racers and reach the finish line first</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Head-To-Head</strong>: Drift through the streets, avoid traffic and earn more points than your opponents</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the thrill of downhill racing that rewards mastery and finesse.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489610/extras/b4db470ccf145f220027a87f09b0b3d6.poster.avif?t=1746548667\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489610/extras/b4db470ccf145f220027a87f09b0b3d6.webm?t=1746548667\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489610/extras/b4db470ccf145f220027a87f09b0b3d6.mp4?t=1746548667\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Open World Exploration</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate through diverse environments:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>City Streets:</strong> Race through urban landscapes illuminated by the glow of streetlights.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mountain Roads:</strong> Challenge yourself on winding paths with breathtaking views.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Abandoned Airports:</strong> Utilize vast open spaces for high-speed stunts and drifts.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover hidden spots to perfect your drifting and perform stunts like jumping over traffic, rivers, or even entire hangars.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Multiplayer and PvP</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete with friends and players worldwide:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Online PvP Modes:</strong> Engage in competitive drifting battles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Leaderboards:</strong> Showcase your drifting skills and climb the global rankings.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prove your skills in a community of drift enthusiasts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489610/extras/d2bf281d4bb2cecfbe5f688d9fda12af.poster.avif?t=1746548667\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489610/extras/d2bf281d4bb2cecfbe5f688d9fda12af.webm?t=1746548667\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489610/extras/d2bf281d4bb2cecfbe5f688d9fda12af.mp4?t=1746548667\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customization and Tuning</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your dream drift car with extensive options:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Visual Customization:</strong> Modify body kits, liveries, rims, and more to reflect your style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Performance Tuning:</strong> Adjust engine performance, suspension, and other parameters to suit your preferences.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your vehicle to match your style!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to Trishu-Drift</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The better you drift, the faster you go!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in the art of drifting with <strong>Trishu-Drift</strong>, where precision and style lead to speed and victory.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Drifting made unique:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enhance your driving strategy with unique mechanics:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nitrous:</strong> Earn nitrous by executing perfect drifts, passing your opponents and winning the race</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the balance between drifting and speed to dominate the competition.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Touge Challenges</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your skills on challenging mountain passes inspired by iconic Japanese touge:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intense Downhill Races:</strong> Navigate tight corners and steep descents that demand precision and control. Drive faster than the other racers and reach the finish line first</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Head-To-Head</strong>: Drift through the streets, avoid traffic and earn more points than your opponents</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the thrill of downhill racing that rewards mastery and finesse.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489610/extras/b4db470ccf145f220027a87f09b0b3d6.poster.avif?t=1746548667\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489610/extras/b4db470ccf145f220027a87f09b0b3d6.webm?t=1746548667\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489610/extras/b4db470ccf145f220027a87f09b0b3d6.mp4?t=1746548667\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Open World Exploration</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate through diverse environments:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>City Streets:</strong> Race through urban landscapes illuminated by the glow of streetlights.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mountain Roads:</strong> Challenge yourself on winding paths with breathtaking views.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Abandoned Airports:</strong> Utilize vast open spaces for high-speed stunts and drifts.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover hidden spots to perfect your drifting and perform stunts like jumping over traffic, rivers, or even entire hangars.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Multiplayer and PvP</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete with friends and players worldwide:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Online PvP Modes:</strong> Engage in competitive drifting battles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Leaderboards:</strong> Showcase your drifting skills and climb the global rankings.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prove your skills in a community of drift enthusiasts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489610/extras/d2bf281d4bb2cecfbe5f688d9fda12af.poster.avif?t=1746548667\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489610/extras/d2bf281d4bb2cecfbe5f688d9fda12af.webm?t=1746548667\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489610/extras/d2bf281d4bb2cecfbe5f688d9fda12af.mp4?t=1746548667\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customization and Tuning</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your dream drift car with extensive options:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Visual Customization:</strong> Modify body kits, liveries, rims, and more to reflect your style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Performance Tuning:</strong> Adjust engine performance, suspension, and other parameters to suit your preferences.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your vehicle to match your style!</p>",
    "short_description": "Trishu-Drift is an open-world drifting game where the better you drift, the faster you go!Master unique drifting mechanics, take on intense touge challenges, and compete online to prove your style and skill. Build your dream car, tune it to perfection, and leave your mark on every corner.",
